### 1. Register and get the JWT Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "secure.user@enterprise.com",
  "firstName": "Secure",
  "lastName": "User"
}

> {%
    // This script captures the token from the JSON response and saves it as a variable!
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}


### 2. Create a Conversation (WITH Token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "title": "My Top Secret Verified Chat"
}


### 3. Create a Conversation (WITHOUT Token - Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This should be blocked"
}